    <item>
      <title>格雷厄姆和特朗普的胜利：南卡罗来纳州参议院决选的六点收获</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/election-takeaways-south-carolina-oklahoma.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统在周二的初选决选中全力支持参议员达林·格雷厄姆。这一招奏效了，让他在今年的共和党参议院初选中保持了不败纪录。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/election-takeaways-south-carolina-oklahoma.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 03:10:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>乡村音乐巨星多莉·帕顿去世，享年 80 岁，歌曲影响数百万人</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/arts/music/dolly-parton-dead.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[她以其独特的个性、外表和才华而闻名，她从农村贫困中崛起，成为一名畅销歌手、词曲作者和企业家。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/arts/music/dolly-parton-dead.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 02:17:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>多莉·帕顿的去世对田纳西人来说是一个沉重的打击：“她是我们中的一员”</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/nashville-mourns-dolly-parton.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这位乡村音乐明星将她的家乡置于音乐和工作的最前沿。 “她激励田纳西人变得更好，”一位居民说。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/nashville-mourns-dolly-parton.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 02:09:20 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>多莉帕顿在与癌症短暂斗争后去世</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/arts/music/dolly-parton-cancer-cause-death.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于健康问题，帕顿最近取消了拉斯维加斯的驻地。一位发言人说，她于周五被送进纳什维尔的一家癌症中心。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/arts/music/dolly-parton-cancer-cause-death.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 01:28:46 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>小埃弗顿·布莱尔赢得了填补大卫·斯科特在佐治亚州众议院席位的竞争</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/everton-blair-georgia-runoff-house-david-scott.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[小埃弗顿·布莱尔将接替斯科特先生长期担任的席位直到一月份，斯科特先生于四月份去世。布莱尔先生不参加深蓝选区下一个完整任期的大选。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/everton-blair-georgia-runoff-house-david-scott.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:41:09 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普煽动选举疑虑的努力因最初的法院命令而得到加强</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/trump-voting-doubt-mail-ballots.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[专家表示，最高法院的初步裁决可能会让选民对邮寄选票感到困惑，尽管特朗普总统的行政命令正在下级法院提起诉讼。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/trump-voting-doubt-mail-ballots.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 23:52:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在特朗普的印地赛车比赛中，一位贵宾。邀请遭到外交冷落</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/trump-indycar-diplomatic-snub.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[活动期间，外国大使将获得免费食物和饮料、雾气风扇和遮阳座椅。然后他们中的一些人是不请自来的。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/trump-indycar-diplomatic-snub.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 23:24:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>多莉帕顿拥有地球天使的声音和担忧</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/arts/music/dolly-parton-voice-appraisal.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[帕顿在她所写的歌曲中充满了希望，这些歌曲讲述了她生活中的艰难时刻和来之不易的胜利。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/arts/music/dolly-parton-voice-appraisal.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 23:10:23 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
